<title>SINGAPORE: ASA GETS SINGAPORE PIONEER STATUS EXTENDED.</title>
<headline>ASA GETS SINGAPORE PIONEER STATUS EXTENDED.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semiconductor company Advanced Systems Automation Ltd said on Thursday it had been granted a further two year extension to its pioneer status to June 30, 1999.</p>
<p>No further details were given in the company statement.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
